    <TD align="left" valign="top" colspan="4" height="115"><b>Spent Levels 1-7 in Tox Forest (before Paineel existed).  Never entered a city or went to the bank during that entire time, as Erudite necros were KOS in much of their own city (Erudin).  Only place I could buy or sell was the single necro hut in Tox Forest. Also could not leave Tox as was KOS in most of Erudin and all of Qeynos. 

At level 8 I got invisibility and was liberated! The rumours were true, there were places in the world that actually had people in them, and were not shrouded in fog 24 hours a day!  I snuck invis through Erudin took boat to Qeynos, snuck through city and got bound outside away from guards.  

A kind soul named Dynaheir (you know her as Eiya) took pity on me and showed me around the real world.  I went to Blackburrow and started working on my faction.  Soon I was even allowed in town and actually used the Bank at level 9 for the first time. Core group that formed guild met at this time in Blackburrow.

At Level 12 I got Bind Affinity and the world was open to explore, as long as I was careful to hide around NPCs as I was still KOS everywhere but Qeynos.  Made the trip alone across continent at Level 12 and went across ocean to Greater Faydark.  Spent levels 12-14 in GF and Butcherblock.  Got good at knowing when to hide from NPCs.  At 15 came back to Freeport and spent 15-18 in Northern Ro and Oasis.  Hunted lots of crocks. Also survived a whole night alone in Kith Forest as a level 18 (had to lay there while feigned death the whole night) Guild formed at this time. Did 18 and 19 in HH killing Orcs.  At 20 went to Lake R. and started killing Webclaw and Aviks.  Did this until level 24.  

Levels 24 - present mostly in L. Rathe. SK, Highhold and R. Mountains.  Have killed enough bandits over the levels that I'm now loved almost everywhere west of Kith Forest, except Hallas.

Presently in Rathe Mountains killing Cyclopses and most recently Hill Giants.  Note, HG have lots of cash and definately worth the risk.

Just got out of Hell Level!  Spent 2 days non-stop in Raider Room and Warrior Room in HK.  

Good necro hunting grounds for level 39-45 is Oasis!  SGs at first, then spectres.  After about 42 you can solo 2 spectres at once!  Great exp and reasonable loot!  Soloed spectres until level 46.  Spent 46-48 in SolB, also went on some planes raids.  Starting at level 49 began soloing SF cyclopses in OOT.  Very good loot, easy experience, and relatively safe.  49 pet can go toe to toe with a SF without needing to fear kite, as long as you have one of the two best casts (can test out pet on oracle isle to make sure you get a good one) and pact it once or twice during the fight.  As I said, easy, safe, exp. and you can earn about 1K pp per night.</b></TD>
